 "notes": "Per-size length lists: each metric size has 'standard' (ISO series) and 'common_extra' (commercially listed, not in the ISO series). Metric capped at 100 mm, inch at 4 in. ISO 4762 screws longer than roughly b ref + a few mm are partially threaded (b ref M3 18, M4 20, M5 22, M6 24, M8 28, M10 32, M12 36 mm per engineersedge) - model thread length accordingly. ISO 7380 and ISO 4017 are fully threaded. ISO 10642 'standard' lengths are unsourced (DIN 7991 commercial lengths given instead). ASME lengths are one supplier's stock, not a standard. Data was extracted through a fetch tool that renders pages to text; fasten.it mass tables lose column alignment, so size/length membership there was reconstructed from mass progression and should be spot-checked if critical."
}